# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Generated corpus slice: 4.5 MB of scored windows, reproducible with
# `python -m sentinelai.pipeline`. The JSON artifacts ARE tracked, because the
# static demo and the README numbers must stay verifiable without a rerun.
artifacts/scored_test_windows.csv

# Node / Vite
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
# Copied out of artifacts/ by `npm run sync-data`; never edited by hand.
web/public/data/

# Secrets: the API refuses to boot without SENTINELAI_JWT_SECRET, and it must
# never be committed.
.env
.env.*

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Scratch planning notes. Several rounds of hero design plans were written to
# think the problem through, then superseded by web/HERO.md once the design
# settled. They are kept out of the tree because seven near-identical drafts of
# one document guarantee that somebody eventually reads the wrong one.
web/HERO-*-PLAN*.md
web/HERO-3D-PLAN*.md
